 * Normalize tool call ID for cross-provider compatibility.
 * OpenAI Responses API generates IDs that are 450+ chars with special characters like `|`.
 * Anthropic APIs require IDs matching ^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$ (max 64 chars).
